{
  "type": "mod",
  "id": 1533,
  "hub_id": 2100,
  "guid": "com.acidphantasm.moretagcolours",
  "name": "More Tag Colours",
  "slug": "more-tag-colours",
  "teaser": "Tired of not having enough tag colours to identify your 15 ammo cases? No more! This mod adds additional colours for you to use! 27 of them!",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2100.png",
  "downloads": 20122,
  "favourites_count": 34,
  "description": "<p>I’m not sure if you’re like me, but I like to tag my cases. The problem is - there’s only 7 tag colours available in Tarkov. This is dumb. I’ve added additional colours for you to use to tag things. Now you can tag all the things!</p>\n<p>There is now a config menu to adjust the original 18 colours to be whatever you want. Try to set them via F12 anywhere except the stash screen.</p>\n<p>If you change them in the stash screen you must go back to the main menu and then re-enter the stash to update all colours.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sBjlG7F.png\" alt=\"sBjlG7F.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/S8zIY61.png\" alt=\"S8zIY61.png\" /></p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">INSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Download More Tag Colours</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Select the BepInEx folder in the 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Drag the BepInEx folder from 7-zip into your SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mZ1aLrW.gif\" alt=\"mZ1aLrW.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">UNINSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/Bepinex/plugins/acidphantasm-moretagcolours</code></li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol></div></div></div>\n<p>If you enjoy my work - you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/acidphantasm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>~</p>\n",
